  "content_id": "16136222",
  "title": "Cosmos ATOM Network Fees",
  "description": "Cosmos (ATOM) Network – Hub of Blockchains\nCosmos is built for cross-chain communication, with quick and affordable transactions.\nHow ATOM...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ4CCRGBM8P8JPV62S5KXKY\">Cosmos (ATOM) Network – Hub of Blockchains</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Cosmos is built for cross-chain communication, with quick and affordable transactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4CCRG99QHD9Y8TBAX2X9F\">How ATOM Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas fees</b> based on network congestion</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Paid in <b>ATOM</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge checks network activity to recommend the best fee for your transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4CCRH7FYSGF2KKATFZ1WN\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Prioritize confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full gas manual setting</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4CCRH6BTZZGWRJ1PQHYH9\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.01 to $0.05 USD</b>.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4CCRHNZWHRNGXX0RD4SPF\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Cosmos powers interoperability. With Edge, your ATOM transfers stay smooth and cheap, even during network peaks.</p>",
